@startuml process_view_uc04_consult_history_phase1_monolithique
title UC-04: Consult Balance and History (Phase 1 Monolithique)
autonumber

actor Client
participant "API Router" as Router
participant "Auth Middleware" as Middleware
participant "Accounts Handler" as Handler
participant "Accounts Service" as Accounts
participant "Ledger Service" as Ledger
database "MySQL" as DB

Client -> Router: GET /api/v1/accounts/:id/history (Bearer Token)
Router -> Middleware: intercept
Middleware -> Middleware: Validate JWT & Extract UserID
Middleware --> Router: Context updated

Router -> Handler: Forward Request
activate Handler
Handler -> Accounts: GetAccountHistory(userID, accountID)
activate Accounts
Accounts -> DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE id=?
DB --> Accounts: Account Model
Accounts -> Accounts: Verify ownership (UserID == account.UserID)

Accounts -> Ledger: GetAccountHistory(accountID)
activate Ledger
Ledger -> DB: SELECT * FROM ledger_entries WHERE account_id=?
DB --> Ledger: List of entries (Credits & Debits)
Ledger -> DB: SELECT SUM(amount) FROM ledger_entries WHERE account_id=?
DB --> Ledger: Computed live balance
Ledger --> Accounts: Entries & Balance Data
deactivate Ledger

Accounts --> Handler: History Response (entries, balance)
deactivate Accounts

Handler --> Client: 200 OK
deactivate Handler

@enduml
